+  implication check between the conditions has failed.
+Residual obligation:
+  filterWords(.IntSeq, W)
+  #Equals
+  seqConcat(filterWords(.IntSeq, W), iCons(120, .IntSeq))
+Residual final result:
+  <k> str(filterWords(.IntSeq, W)) ~> .K </k>
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
