+cmp \
+  <(kast solution.mpy --definition verification-mut-kompiled \
+      --module VERIFICATION --sort Module --expand-macros --output json) \
+  <(kast --expression solutionProgram \
+      --definition verification-mut-kompiled --module VERIFICATION \
+      --sort Module --expand-macros --output json)
+EXIT STATUS: 1 (expected: the executed term is materially different)
+OUTPUT:
+/dev/fd/63 /dev/fd/62 differ: byte 26843, line 1
+
+COMMAND 3 (cwd=/tmp/audit-work/143-body-mut):
+kprove spec.k --definition verification-mut-kompiled --spec-module SPEC \
+  --claims SPEC.loop-invariant --output pretty
+EXIT STATUS: 1 (expected)
+RELEVANT OUTPUT:
+kore-exec: Warning (WarnStuckClaimState)
+kore-exec: Warning (WarnUnexploredBranches): 4 branches were still unexplored
+Residual includes:
+  #Not (96 #Equals isLen(C))
+  #Not (filterWords(selectWord(A,C),R) #Equals filterWords(A,R))
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
