+Residual final result:
+  <k> str(filterWords(.IntSeq, W)) ~> .K </k>
+[Error] Prover: backend terminated because the configuration cannot be
+rewritten further.
+
+The mutation parsed and reached the end-to-end final state; failure was the
+intended unmet result equality, not a parser/build/timeout error.
